Arun Bhandary, whose knack towards integrating people\'s wishes with bricks, concrete and steel is next to none! Mr Bhandary collaborates with his dynamic team individually and the success stories of his personification are now within the broad public domain.<br/>\r\n\r\nFor quintessential homes of your dreams or any other realty project in your thoughts; think no beyond Arun Builders & Developers ... where the results always exceed expectations!\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Mahesh Prabhu</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                       Arun Bhandary Builders & Developers are a trust worthy enterprise. Reliable and hassle free dealings. As I know Mr.Arun for decades as he is very passionate on quality and all his dealings are transparent.<br/>\r\n\r\nA thorough professional with whom we can look forward for our Return Of Investment.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Rajnish N</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                        One of the most renowned builders in the city with quality construction, elegant design within budget promised. This company has houses/villas for every kind of requirements with various budget options and types of property and location. I personally know Arun for several years, impressed with the service he provides to this society.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Roshan Britto</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                       If you really want your dream home then you must for sure contact ARUN BHANDARY BUILDER\'S & DEVELOPERS , they are just awesome . They do work on there tagline , they really build your dreams , no doubt I ll rate then 5 if not more. GOOD GOING GUYS hope you guys build many dream construction all the best\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Kaushik Bhandary</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                       Flexibility and understanding customer needs will surely get you all the success. Being satisfied customer of Arun Bhandary Builders & developers I wish all the success to Mr. Arun.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Loynel Lobo</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                        I personally visited the farm house. Land title is clear and free from encumbrance. Can get credit facility from bank. Income generating approx 40000 per month. Worth buying. If expanded can generate more income.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Hemasundar Rao</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                        Quality as promised. Construction with best practices in the industry. Timely delivery. Value for money. And most importantly the houses are just beautiful in elevation and looks and finish.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Vandan Pinto</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                        In Real Estate, Honesty, Quality, Integrity & Transperancy are key to building trust with clients. I would recommend them for there quality services and honesty. Best of luck 🇮🇳👍\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Krishna</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <article class=\"abt9-card\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-quote\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-quote-left\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-stars\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\"></i>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-review\">\r\n                        Good genuine and trusted builder as i have personaly owned house built by him. I am totaly satisfied with his work.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-card-bottom\">\r\n                        <div>\r\n                            <h3 class=\"abt9-client\">Sandeep Anchan</h3>\r\n                            <div class=\"abt9-client-role\">Home Owner</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"abt9-client-mark\">\r\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-house\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </article>\r\n\r\n\r\n                \r\n\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         FEATURED QUOTE\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- =========================================================\r\n         CTA\r\n    ========================================================= -->\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"abt9-cta\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"abt9-cta-box\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"abt9-cta-content\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"abt9-cta-label\">\r\n                        Start Your Home Journey\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <h2 class=\"abt9-cta-title\">\r\n                        Your Story Could Be Next.\r\n                    </h2>\r\n\r\n                    <p class=\"abt9-cta-text\">\r\n                        From choosing the right plot to creating a home\r\n                        around your lifestyle, let us help you turn your\r\n                        vision into a place you can truly call your own.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"http://localhost/arun-bhandary-builders/contact-us\" class=\"abt9-cta-button\">\r\n                        Let\'s Talk\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right\"></i>\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </section>\r\n</article>', 'Testimonials', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '68-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-30 11:55:04', '2026-10-30 11:55:04', '', 68, 'http://localhost/arun-bhandary-builders/?p=69', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
